# Copy to .dev.vars (Cloudflare Workers reads it in `wrangler dev`) and fill in.
# Names only here - never commit real values. In production it is a Worker secret: `wrangler secret put ADMIN_KEY`.

# Server-side secrets
# The key for the private switch at /admin.html and /api/admin (Bearer token). Any long random string.
# ADMIN_KEY=

# Local paths
# FFMPEG=          (tools/shots.mjs: full path to ffmpeg when it is not on PATH)
